#: ../developer/local-accounts.md:1
msgid "Accounts and the waiting list"
msgstr "账号与等候名单"

#: ../developer/local-accounts.md:3
msgid ""
"Cloud Agent has one account system, its own. People sign up with an email"
" address and password, or a phone number and code, verify it, sign in, "
"and apply for Agent use through a waiting list that administrators "
"review. There is no other sign-in and no mode to choose: HybridInference "
"Gateway sign-in, admission and inference were removed ([cutover](upgrade-"
"notes.md#independent-accounts-cutover))."
msgstr ""
"Cloud Agent 只有一套账号系统，就是它自己的。用户用邮箱和密码、或手机号和验证码注册，完成验证后登录，再通过等候名单申请使用 "
"Agent，由管理员审核。没有其他登录方式，也没有模式可选：HybridInference Gateway 的登录、准入和推理都已移除（[切换"
"](upgrade-notes.md#independent-accounts-cutover)）。"

#: ../developer/local-accounts.md:10
msgid ""
"Designs: [independent accounts and waiting "
"list](../agents/specs/2026-10-27-independent-accounts-and-waitlist-design"
".zh-CN.md), [independent accounts only](../agents/specs/2026-10-30"
"-independent-accounts-only.md) and the [feature parity "
"table](../agents/specs/2026-10-29-account-feature-parity.zh-CN.md)."
msgstr ""
"设计文档：[独立账号与等候名单](../agents/specs/2026-10-27-independent-accounts-and-"
"waitlist-design.zh-CN.md)、[仅保留独立账号](../agents/specs/2026-10-30"
"-independent-accounts-only.md)和[功能对齐表](../agents/specs/2026-10-29"
"-account-feature-parity.zh-CN.md)。"

#: ../developer/local-accounts.md:15
msgid ""
"Administrators work in **Admin → Users**. **People** lists every account "
"with its application state, account state, teams and last sign-in, and "
"**Review** opens an account's actions, note and sign-in history. "
"**Teams** lists every team ([Teams](operations.md#teams)). The old "
"`/admin/accounts` and `/admin/teams` addresses open these pages. The "
"account pages follow the administrator's language (English or Simplified "
"Chinese); most other admin pages are English only."
msgstr ""
"管理员在 **Admin → Users** 中工作。**People** "
"列出每个账号的申请状态、账号状态、所属团队和最近登录时间，**Review** 会打开某个账号的操作、备注和登录历史。**Teams** "
"列出所有团队（[Teams](operations.md#teams)）。旧地址 `/admin/accounts` 和 "
"`/admin/teams` 会打开这些页面。账号页面跟随管理员的语言（英文或简体中文）；其他管理页面大多只有英文。"

#: ../developer/local-accounts.md:23
msgid "How a request is admitted"
msgstr "请求如何准入"

#: ../developer/local-accounts.md:25
msgid ""
"Every protected owner or administration request, and `/v1/session/me`, "
"reads the account's current state from this database through the account "
"directory (`cloud_agent/accounts/directory.py`). Nothing is cached, no "
"other service is asked, and no account ID leaves the service."
msgstr ""
"每个受保护的所有者请求或管理请求，以及 "
"`/v1/session/me`，都通过账号目录（`cloud_agent/accounts/directory.py`）从本数据库读取账号的当前状态。不做缓存，不询问其他服务，账号"
" ID 也不会离开本服务。"

#: ../developer/local-accounts.md
msgid "Permission"
msgstr "权限"

#: ../developer/local-accounts.md
msgid "Granted when"
msgstr "何时授予"

#: ../developer/local-accounts.md
msgid "Allows"
msgstr "允许"

#: ../developer/local-accounts.md
msgid "`agent.use`"
msgstr ""

#: ../developer/local-accounts.md
msgid "The waiting-list application is approved"
msgstr "等候名单申请已获批准"

#: ../developer/local-accounts.md
msgid "Owner APIs, subject to per-resource ownership checks"
msgstr "所有者 API，每个资源仍要单独检查所有权"

#: ../developer/local-accounts.md
msgid "`agent.admin`"
msgstr ""

#: ../developer/local-accounts.md
msgid "The account is approved and marked administrator"
msgstr "账号已获批准并标记为管理员"

#: ../developer/local-accounts.md
msgid "Administration, including runner-host APIs; requires `agent.use`"
msgstr "管理功能，包括 runner 主机 API；需要 `agent.use`"

#: ../developer/local-accounts.md:35
msgid ""
"`ADMIN_TOKEN` also authorizes administration and the recovery settings "
"page, even before any administrator account exists. Host and worker "
"credentials, attempt lease fences and ownership checks are separate "
"controls."
msgstr ""
"`ADMIN_TOKEN` 也能授权管理操作和恢复用的设置页面，即使还没有任何管理员账号。主机和 worker 凭据、attempt "
"租约栅栏以及所有权检查是彼此独立的控制。"

#: ../developer/local-accounts.md:39
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"A decision grants access only when it is well formed: its permissions are"
" unique and recognized, `agent.admin` comes with `agent.use`, and it is "
"for the account asked about. Account roles and profile fields are not "
"authorization inputs. The session response carries `agent_access: "
"{allowed, permissions}`, and the web app denies access when that field is"
" missing."
msgstr ""
"只有格式正确的决定才会授予访问：权限不重复且可识别，`agent.admin` 必须与 `agent.use` "
"同时出现，并且决定针对的正是被询问的账号。账号角色和资料字段不参与授权。会话响应带有 `agent_access: {allowed, "
"permissions}`，缺少这个字段时 Web 应用会拒绝访问。"

#: ../developer/local-accounts.md
msgid "Condition"
msgstr "情况"

#: ../developer/local-accounts.md
msgid "Result"
msgstr "结果"

#: ../developer/local-accounts.md
msgid "No session, or a revoked or expired one"
msgstr "没有会话，或会话已撤销、已过期"

#: ../developer/local-accounts.md
msgid "401; the web app returns to sign-in"
msgstr "401；Web 应用回到登录页"

#: ../developer/local-accounts.md
msgid "Signed in without `agent.use`"
msgstr "已登录但没有 `agent.use`"

#: ../developer/local-accounts.md
msgid "403; the web app shows the waiting list"
msgstr "403；Web 应用显示等候名单"

#: ../developer/local-accounts.md
msgid "Account unknown, unverified, suspended or deleted"
msgstr "账号未知、未验证、已停用或已删除"

#: ../developer/local-accounts.md
msgid ""
"`subject_unavailable`: sign-in is refused and existing sessions get a "
"denial"
msgstr "`subject_unavailable`：拒绝登录，已有会话收到拒绝决定"

#: ../developer/local-accounts.md
msgid "The account store cannot be read"
msgstr "无法读取账号存储"

#: ../developer/local-accounts.md
msgid "503; the web app hides protected content and offers a retry"
msgstr "503；Web 应用隐藏受保护内容并提供重试"

#: ../developer/local-accounts.md
msgid ""
"`AGENT_LOCAL_SESSION_SECRET` or `AGENT_SOURCE_CONTROL_ENCRYPTION_KEY` "
"missing, or a retired Gateway variable set"
msgstr ""
"缺少 `AGENT_LOCAL_SESSION_SECRET` 或 "
"`AGENT_SOURCE_CONTROL_ENCRYPTION_KEY`，或设置了已停用的 Gateway 变量"

#: ../developer/local-accounts.md
msgid "The control plane does not start, and names what to set or remove"
msgstr "控制平面不会启动，并指出需要设置或删除的项"

#: ../developer/local-accounts.md:53
msgid ""
"Owner streams (job events, the change feed, terminal output) re-read the "
"session and the admission every 30 seconds between frames, and end on a "
"refusal. Every stream also ends after 15 minutes; the client reconnects "
"and is admitted again. An MCP OAuth callback that returns after the "
"account lost `agent.use` is refused without consuming the authorization."
msgstr ""
"所有者的流（任务事件、变更推送、终端输出）每 30 秒在两帧之间重新读取一次会话和准入状态，遇到拒绝即结束。每个流最长 15 "
"分钟后也会结束，客户端重新连接并再次准入。账号失去 `agent.use` 之后才返回的 MCP OAuth 回调会被拒绝，授权不会被消耗。"

#: ../developer/local-accounts.md:59
msgid ""
"Code: "
"[`accounts/agent_access.py`](../../apps/backend/cloud_agent/accounts/agent_access.py),"
" "
"[`accounts/directory.py`](../../apps/backend/cloud_agent/accounts/directory.py),"
" [`api/deps.py`](../../apps/backend/cloud_agent/api/deps.py) and "
"[`api/session.py`](../../apps/backend/cloud_agent/api/session.py)."
msgstr ""
"代码：[`accounts/agent_access.py`](../../apps/backend/cloud_agent/accounts/agent_access.py)、[`accounts/directory.py`](../../apps/backend/cloud_agent/accounts/directory.py)、[`api/deps.py`](../../apps/backend/cloud_agent/api/deps.py)"
" 和 [`api/session.py`](../../apps/backend/cloud_agent/api/session.py)。"

#: ../developer/local-accounts.md:64
msgid "Enabling it"
msgstr "启用本地模式"

#: ../developer/local-accounts.md:66
msgid ""
"A deployment needs its own, empty database. At startup the control plane "
"binds an empty database to the account system "
"(`agent_local_identity_namespace`). It refuses a database bound to a "
"Gateway issuer, or one holding owner data without a binding (every "
"Gateway-era database), and names the cutover runbook. Nothing skips this "
"check or migrates Gateway owners. `python -m "
"cloud_agent.deployment.identity_namespace --check` runs it read-only."
msgstr ""
"每个部署需要一个自己的空数据库。控制平面启动时会把空数据库绑定到账号系统（`agent_local_identity_namespace`）。已绑定到"
" Gateway issuer 的数据库，或存有所有者数据却没有绑定的数据库（所有 Gateway "
"时期的数据库都是如此），都会被拒绝，并给出切换操作手册。没有办法跳过这项检查，也不会迁移 Gateway 的所有者。`python -m "
"cloud_agent.deployment.identity_namespace --check` 以只读方式执行同样的检查。"

#: ../developer/local-accounts.md:74
msgid ""
"Startup, and `deploy/control-plane/deploy.sh` before it pulls anything, "
"also refuse every variable left from the Gateway integration: "
"`AGENT_AUTH_MODE`, `GATEWAY_*`, `IDENTITY_*`, "
"`AGENT_SESSION_REDIRECT_URI`, `AGENT_GATEWAY_URL`, "
"`AGENT_WEB_GATEWAY_URL`, `AGENT_WEB_FEATURE_RAG` and the rest of "
"`RETIRED_GATEWAY_VARIABLES` in `cloud_agent/accounts/config.py`. A host "
"that still sets one is refused too."
msgstr ""
"启动时，以及 `deploy/control-plane/deploy.sh` 在拉取任何内容之前，都会拒绝 Gateway "
"集成遗留的所有变量：`AGENT_AUTH_MODE`、`GATEWAY_*`、`IDENTITY_*`、`AGENT_SESSION_REDIRECT_URI`、`AGENT_GATEWAY_URL`、`AGENT_WEB_GATEWAY_URL`、`AGENT_WEB_FEATURE_RAG`，以及"
" `cloud_agent/accounts/config.py` 中 `RETIRED_GATEWAY_VARIABLES` "
"的其余各项。仍设置了其中任何一个的主机同样会被拒绝。"

#: ../developer/local-accounts.md
msgid "Value"
msgstr "值"

#: ../developer/local-accounts.md
msgid "Purpose"
msgstr "用途"

#: ../developer/local-accounts.md
msgid "`AGENT_LOCAL_SESSION_SECRET`"
msgstr "`AGENT_LOCAL_SESSION_SECRET`"

#: ../developer/local-accounts.md
msgid ""
"At least 32 random bytes, different from `AGENT_SESSION_SECRET`. Keys the"
" stored hashes of sessions, emailed tokens and abuse counters. The `keys`"
" service generates it on a new installation with the bundled database."
msgstr ""
"至少 32 个随机字节，且不同于 "
"`AGENT_SESSION_SECRET`。用作会话、邮件令牌和防滥用计数器所存哈希的密钥。在使用内置数据库的新安装上，`keys` "
"服务会自动生成它。"

#: ../developer/local-accounts.md
msgid "`AGENT_SOURCE_CONTROL_ENCRYPTION_KEY`"
msgstr "`AGENT_SOURCE_CONTROL_ENCRYPTION_KEY`"

#: ../developer/local-accounts.md
msgid ""
"Required at startup. Encrypts personal model keys and other stored "
"credentials, each in its own domain. A new deployment generates it into "
"its settings."
msgstr "启动时必需。用于加密个人模型密钥和其他已存凭据，每类凭据各用独立的域。新部署会把它生成到自己的设置中。"

#: ../developer/local-accounts.md
msgid "`AGENT_MODEL_CONNECTIONS_ENABLED`"
msgstr "`AGENT_MODEL_CONNECTIONS_ENABLED`"

#: ../developer/local-accounts.md
msgid ""
"On unless `0`, `false` or `no`. When off, no model can be set up and no "
"new turn starts, on any connection."
msgstr "默认开启，设为 `0`、`false` 或 `no` 时关闭。关闭后无法配置任何模型，任何连接上也不会启动新的轮次。"

#: ../developer/local-accounts.md
msgid "`AGENT_WEB_BASE_URL`"
msgstr "`AGENT_WEB_BASE_URL`"

#: ../developer/local-accounts.md
msgid ""
"Seeds the **Web app URL** setting (Admin → Settings → General), which "
"first-run setup also asks for. It is the only base for emailed links; a "
"request's `Host` is never used."
msgstr ""
"作为 **Web app URL** 设置（Admin → Settings → "
"General）的初始值，首次运行设置时也会询问它。它是邮件链接唯一的基础地址；从不使用请求的 `Host`。"

#: ../developer/local-accounts.md
msgid "`AGENT_PUBLIC_API_URL`"
msgstr "`AGENT_PUBLIC_API_URL`"

#: ../developer/local-accounts.md
msgid ""
"Seeds the **Public API URL** setting, beside it: this API's public "
"address, which OAuth callbacks name."
msgstr "作为旁边 **Public API URL** 设置的初始值：即本 API 的公开地址，OAuth 回调会用到它。"

#: ../developer/local-accounts.md:89
msgid ""
"Everything else is under **Admin → Settings → Accounts**, imported once "
"from its variable ([ENVIRONMENT.md](../../ENVIRONMENT.md)): public sign-"
"up and email verification, the approval policy (`manual`, or `domains` "
"with the signup domain list), administrator notices and email addresses, "
"the Terms of Service, the session lifetime, the sign-in and sign-up "
"limits, the email transport (SMTP, Tencent SES or a registered one), "
"phone sign-in with Tencent SMS, and Turnstile. Secrets are encrypted and "
"never shown again. While verification is required and no mail transport "
"is set, email sign-up is closed and account recovery answers 503; with "
"verification off, sign-up works without mail."
msgstr ""
"其余设置都在 **Admin → Settings → Accounts** "
"中，每项都从对应变量导入一次（[ENVIRONMENT.md](../../ENVIRONMENT.md)）：公开注册和邮箱验证、审批策略（`manual`，或带注册域名列表的"
" `domains`）、管理员通知和管理员邮箱、服务条款、会话有效期、登录和注册限制、邮件发送方式（SMTP、腾讯云 SES "
"或已注册的其他方式）、通过腾讯云短信的手机登录，以及 "
"Turnstile。密钥类设置加密保存，保存后不再显示。要求邮箱验证但没有配置邮件发送时，邮箱注册关闭，账号找回返回 "
"503；关闭验证后，没有邮件也能注册。"

#: ../developer/local-accounts.md:100
msgid ""
"The web server must reach the same control plane "
"(`AGENT_CONTROL_PLANE_URL`); it reads `GET /v1/auth/config` and `GET "
"/v1/auth/options` to learn what its sign-in pages offer. Hosts need "
"nothing for accounts beyond their control-plane, MCP and model-relay "
"tunnels. In **Admin → Servers → Server setup**, administrators select "
"only the control-plane machine."
msgstr ""
"Web 服务器必须能访问同一个控制平面（`AGENT_CONTROL_PLANE_URL`）；它读取 `GET /v1/auth/config` "
"和 `GET /v1/auth/options` 来决定登录页面提供哪些选项。除了控制平面、MCP "
"和模型中继三条隧道，主机不需要为账号做任何配置。在 **Admin → Servers → Server setup** "
"中，管理员只需选择控制平面所在的机器。"

#: ../developer/local-accounts.md:106
msgid "The first administrator"
msgstr "首位管理员"

#: ../developer/local-accounts.md:108
msgid ""
"Signing up first grants nothing. While no administrator exists, every "
"control-plane process logs a one-time setup code at startup "
"(`agent_local_setup_pending`, at WARNING). Exchange it at "
"`/setup/administrator` for an administrator that signs in with a login "
"name and needs no email. Wrong codes are limited to 10 per address in 15 "
"minutes. Creating an administrator any other way also closes setup."
msgstr ""
"第一个注册的人不会得到任何权限。在还没有管理员时，每个控制平面进程启动时都会记录一个一次性设置码（`agent_local_setup_pending`，WARNING"
" 级别）。在 `/setup/administrator` 用它换取一个管理员账号，该账号用登录名登录，不需要邮箱。错误的设置码每个地址 15 "
"分钟内最多尝试 10 次。用其他任何方式创建了管理员，设置入口也会关闭。"

#: ../developer/local-accounts.md:115
msgid ""
"With the deployment's database credential and local secret, you can do "
"the same from the command line. The password is read from standard input "
"or a prompt, never from the arguments:"
msgstr "持有部署的数据库凭据和本地密钥，也可以在命令行完成同样的操作。密码从标准输入或提示中读取，从不从命令行参数读取："

#: ../developer/local-accounts.md:126
msgid ""
"`--create-*` makes a verified, approved account, which is an "
"administrator unless you pass `--member`. `--account-id` makes an "
"existing verified account an administrator; add `--approve` to approve "
"its application first, since only an approved account can administer. "
"Each step is the audited action the administration API uses, with the "
"actor `deployment-bootstrap`."
msgstr ""
"`--create-*` 创建一个已验证、已批准的账号，除非传入 `--member`，否则它是管理员。`--account-id` "
"把一个已验证的现有账号设为管理员；加上 `--approve` 会先批准它的申请，因为只有已批准的账号才能担任管理员。每一步都是管理 API "
"使用的同一个带审计的操作，操作者记为 `deployment-bootstrap`。"

#: ../developer/local-accounts.md:132
msgid ""
"An account whose proven email is on the **administrator email addresses**"
" setting (seeded by `AGENT_LOCAL_ADMIN_EMAILS`) is approved and made an "
"administrator when it signs in. Proven means that a link sent to the "
"address was followed (verification, an address change or a password "
"reset), or that the operator created the account. An address accepted "
"while verification is off is not proven, so listing it does not hand the "
"console to whoever signs up with it first; its holder proves it with a "
"password reset. The list stays in charge: withdrawing a listed account's "
"administration or access, or declining it, is refused with 409 "
"`listed_admin_address` until the address is off the list or the account "
"is suspended, because the next sign-in would grant it back."
msgstr ""
"如果账号已证明的邮箱在 **administrator email addresses** 设置中（初始值来自 "
"`AGENT_LOCAL_ADMIN_EMAILS`），它登录时会被批准并设为管理员。已证明是指：发到该地址的链接被打开过（验证、更换地址或重置密码），或者账号由运维人员创建。关闭验证期间接受的地址不算已证明，所以把它列入名单，并不会把控制台交给第一个用它注册的人；地址持有者可以通过重置密码来证明。名单始终说了算：撤销名单内账号的管理员身份或访问权限，或拒绝它的申请，都会以"
" 409 `listed_admin_address` 被拒绝，直到地址移出名单或账号被停用，因为下次登录时名单又会重新授予。"

#: ../developer/local-accounts.md:144
msgid "Importing accounts from FreeInference"
msgstr "从 FreeInference 导入账号"

#: ../developer/local-accounts.md:146
msgid ""
"A deployment can be seeded once with FreeInference's active users. Each "
"becomes an approved account that signs in with the same email, login name"
" or phone and the same password: both services use the same Argon2id "
"parameters, so the hash verifies unchanged. Nothing links the two "
"accounts afterwards."
msgstr ""
"部署可以一次性导入 FreeInference "
"的活跃用户。每个用户都成为已批准的账号，用相同的邮箱、登录名或手机号以及相同的密码登录：两个服务使用相同的 Argon2id "
"参数，所以哈希无需改动即可校验。导入之后，两边的账号不再有任何关联。"

#: ../developer/local-accounts.md:151
msgid ""
"Export from the FreeInference database, read-only. Users pending "
"approval, rejected, suspended or deleted there are left out:"
msgstr "以只读方式从 FreeInference 数据库导出。在那里待审批、被拒绝、已停用或已删除的用户不会导出："

#: ../developer/local-accounts.md:164
msgid ""
"The file holds password hashes: keep it readable by its owner only, copy "
"it over SSH, and delete it after the import. Then, on the control plane:"
msgstr "这个文件含有密码哈希：只让文件所有者可读，通过 SSH 复制，导入后删除。然后在控制平面上执行："

#: ../developer/local-accounts.md:172
msgid ""
"Without `--apply` nothing is written. Both report how many accounts are "
"(or would be) imported, which lines were skipped and why, and what was "
"dropped, by line number only."
msgstr "不加 `--apply` 时不写入任何内容。两种方式都会报告导入了（或将导入）多少账号、跳过了哪些行及原因、丢弃了哪些内容，只按行号报告。"

#: ../developer/local-accounts.md:176
msgid ""
"An account any of whose identifiers already exists here is skipped whole,"
" so a second run imports nothing twice."
msgstr "任一标识已在本系统存在的账号会被整体跳过，因此再次运行也不会重复导入。"

#: ../developer/local-accounts.md:178
msgid ""
"An email FreeInference verified counts as proven; an unverified one is "
"imported unverified. A phone is imported only if verified, and a login "
"name only with a password. A hash in another format is dropped, and its "
"holder resets the password by email."
msgstr ""
"FreeInference "
"验证过的邮箱视为已证明；未验证的邮箱按未验证导入。手机号只有验证过才导入，登录名只在有密码时导入。其他格式的哈希会被丢弃，持有者需通过邮件重置密码。"

#: ../developer/local-accounts.md:182
msgid ""
"Each account is created and approved in one transaction, audited as "
"`agent.local_account.import` by `operator:account-import`. No mail is "
"sent, no model connection is created, and the Terms are not recorded as "
"accepted."
msgstr ""
"每个账号在一个事务中创建并批准，审计记录为 `agent.local_account.import`，操作者为 `operator"
":account-import`。不发送邮件，不创建模型连接，也不记录为已接受服务条款。"

#: ../developer/local-accounts.md:186
msgid "Identity and admission"
msgstr "身份与准入"

#: ../developer/local-accounts.md:188
msgid ""
"An identity is verified when the account has no unverified email and at "
"least one verified sign-in identity: a confirmed email, a login name "
"(made by the operator) or a phone confirmed by code. Each identity "
"records what verified it in `verified_by`: `link`, `code`, `operator`, or"
" `policy` for an email accepted unproven while verification is off. Only "
"`link` and `operator` prove a mailbox, which the administrator address "
"list and the signup domain list require."
msgstr ""
"账号没有未验证的邮箱，并且至少有一个已验证的登录标识时，身份即为已验证：已确认的邮箱、登录名（由运维人员创建）或通过验证码确认的手机号。每个标识都在"
" `verified_by` 中记录验证方式：`link`、`code`、`operator`，或者 "
"`policy`（关闭验证期间未经证明就接受的邮箱）。只有 `link` 和 `operator` "
"能证明邮箱归属，管理员地址名单和注册域名列表都要求这一点。"

#: ../developer/local-accounts.md:196
msgid ""
"A password reset that proves a `policy` email takes the account back from"
" whoever claimed the address first. Their display name, language, Terms "
"acceptance and application text are cleared, a pending application "
"returns to not applied, and the reset page and an `account_reclaimed` "
"mail tell the holder. Administrators' decisions, the sign-in history and "
"Agent data stay; a holder who finds work that is not theirs can delete "
"the account or ask an administrator to erase it."
msgstr ""
"通过重置密码证明了一个 `policy` "
"邮箱，就从最先占用该地址的人手中收回了账号。对方填写的显示名称、语言、服务条款接受记录和申请内容会被清除，待审批的申请恢复为未申请，重置页面和一封"
" `account_reclaimed` 邮件会告知持有者。管理员的决定、登录历史和 Agent "
"数据保持不变；持有者如果发现不属于自己的工作，可以删除账号或请管理员彻底清除。"

#: ../developer/local-accounts.md:204
msgid ""
"The view `agent_local_account_access` answers whether an account is "
"verified, may sign in and may use Agent. Every SQL gate reads it, and an "
"account missing a row has no access."
msgstr ""
"视图 `agent_local_account_access` 给出账号是否已验证、能否登录、能否使用 Agent。每个 SQL "
"门禁都读它，缺少对应行的账号没有任何访问权限。"

#: ../developer/local-accounts.md
msgid "Account"
msgstr "账号"

#: ../developer/local-accounts.md
msgid "Signs in"
msgstr "登录"

#: ../developer/local-accounts.md
