msgstr "所有者路由、任务、终端、MCP"

#: ../developer/local-accounts.md
msgid "Administration"
msgstr "管理权限"

#: ../developer/local-accounts.md
msgid "Identity unverified"
msgstr "身份未验证"

#: ../developer/local-accounts.md
msgid "Verification and recovery only"
msgstr "仅验证与账号恢复流程"

#: ../developer/local-accounts.md
msgid "No"
msgstr "否"

#: ../developer/local-accounts.md
msgid "Verified, not applied or pending"
msgstr "已验证，未申请或待审批"

#: ../developer/local-accounts.md
msgid "Yes"
msgstr "是"

#: ../developer/local-accounts.md
msgid "Verified, approved"
msgstr "已验证，已获批"

#: ../developer/local-accounts.md
msgid "Yes, with ownership checks"
msgstr "是，仍检查所有权"

#: ../developer/local-accounts.md
msgid "Verified, rejected or revoked"
msgstr "已验证，申请被拒绝或准入被撤销"

#: ../developer/local-accounts.md
msgid "Yes, and sees the reason"
msgstr "可以，并能看到原因"

#: ../developer/local-accounts.md
msgid "Approved and marked administrator"
msgstr "已获批且标记为管理员"

#: ../developer/local-accounts.md
msgid "Suspended"
msgstr "账号已停用"

#: ../developer/local-accounts.md
msgid "No; every session is revoked"
msgstr "否；所有会话均被撤销"

#: ../developer/local-accounts.md
msgid "Deleted"
msgstr "已删除"

#: ../developer/local-accounts.md
msgid "No; signed out everywhere, links ended"
msgstr "不能；已在所有浏览器上退出，链接全部失效"

#: ../developer/local-accounts.md:218
msgid ""
"With the `domains` policy, an account whose proven email domain is on the"
" list (exactly, or under a `*.` entry) is approved, audited as `signup-"
"policy`, as soon as it is verified. With an empty list every verified "
"account is approved, phone accounts included; otherwise a phone account, "
"which has no domain, waits for review."
msgstr ""
"使用 `domains` 策略时，已证明的邮箱域名在列表中（完全匹配，或属于某个 `*.` 条目的子域）的账号，一经验证即被批准，审计记录为 "
"`signup-policy`。列表为空时，所有已验证账号都会被批准，包括手机号账号；否则手机号账号没有域名，需要等待审核。"

#: ../developer/local-accounts.md:224
msgid ""
"The administrator flag grants nothing on its own, and granting it never "
"approves an account. Suspension revokes the account's sessions, clears "
"the flag and turns an approval into a revocation. Restoring lets the "
"account sign in and apply again, and grants nothing back. Administrators "
"cannot suspend themselves or remove their own access; `ADMIN_TOKEN` can."
msgstr ""
"管理员标记本身不授予任何权限，授予它也不会批准账号。停用会撤销账号的会话、清除标记，并把批准变为撤销。恢复后账号可以重新登录和申请，但不会恢复任何权限。管理员不能停用自己，也不能撤销自己的访问权限；`ADMIN_TOKEN`"
" 可以。"

#: ../developer/local-accounts.md:230
msgid ""
"Every account or admission change increments the account's `version` "
"(`WaitlistEntry.version`). An administrator action names the version it "
"read and is refused with 409 `version_conflict` if the account changed "
"since. The change and its `agent_admin_audit_log` row commit together; if"
" the row cannot be written, the change still commits and the Audit log "
"page counts the miss. The row keeps the states, version, reason and both "
"names as they were, and never a password, hash or token. The acting "
"administrator's own permission is checked again in that transaction "
"(`actor_not_admin`)."
msgstr ""
"账号或准入的每次变更都会递增账号的 `version`（即 "
"`WaitlistEntry.version`）。管理员操作会带上它读到的版本，如果账号在此之后有变化，就以 409 "
"`version_conflict` 拒绝。变更和它的 `agent_admin_audit_log` "
"行一起提交；审计行写不进去时，变更仍会提交，Audit log "
"页面会计入这次遗漏。审计行保存当时的状态、版本、理由和双方名称，从不保存密码、哈希或令牌。执行操作的管理员自己的权限会在同一事务中再检查一次（`actor_not_admin`）。"

#: ../developer/local-accounts.md:239
msgid "Sessions and credentials"
msgstr "会话与凭据"

#: ../developer/local-accounts.md:241
msgid ""
"The session cookie, `__Host-cloud_agent_local_session` (plain "
"`cloud_agent_local_session` where cookies are not `Secure`), names a "
"browser. A browser holds up to five signed-in accounts, each with its own"
" session row; past five, sign-in answers `browser_full`. Every sign-in "
"rotates the cookie. Switching needs no password while the chosen "
"account's session lasts."
msgstr ""
"会话 cookie `__Host-cloud_agent_local_session`（在 cookie 不带 `Secure` 的地方是普通的"
" "
"`cloud_agent_local_session`）标识一个浏览器。一个浏览器最多同时登录五个账号，每个账号有自己的会话行；超过五个时登录返回"
" `browser_full`。每次登录都会轮换 cookie 的值。所选账号的会话有效期内，切换账号无需密码。"

#: ../developer/local-accounts.md:247
msgid ""
"Each web app request names the account its tab shows (`X-Agent-Account`; "
"streams use `agent_account`). Once the browser's active account is "
"another, the request is refused with 409 `account_switched` and the tab "
"reloads, so a stale tab never acts as the next account."
msgstr ""
"Web 应用的每个请求都会注明其标签页显示的账号（`X-Agent-Account`；流使用 "
"`agent_account`）。一旦浏览器的当前账号已换成别的，请求会以 409 `account_switched` "
"被拒绝，标签页随即重新加载，这样停留在旧账号的标签页不会以新账号的身份操作。"

#: ../developer/local-accounts.md:251
msgid ""
"A browser that signed in to an account before carries a signed device "
"cookie (`__Host-cloud_agent_device`) and has its own sign-in window, so "
"others guessing that account's password from the same address cannot lock"
" it out there."
msgstr ""
"曾经登录过某账号的浏览器带有签名的设备 cookie（`__Host-"
"cloud_agent_device`），并有自己独立的登录计数窗口，因此其他人从同一地址猜测该账号的密码，也无法把它锁在这个浏览器之外。"

#: ../developer/local-accounts.md:255
msgid ""
"Passwords use HybridInference's Argon2id parameters and rules. Hashing "
"runs on four threads with at most 64 waiting; beyond that a request gets "
"503."
msgstr "密码采用 HybridInference 的 Argon2id 参数和规则。哈希计算在四个线程上运行，最多 64 个排队；超出时请求返回 503。"

#: ../developer/local-accounts.md:257
msgid ""
"A session value is `cals1.` plus 256 random bits, and the database keeps "
"only its HMAC, keyed from `AGENT_LOCAL_SESSION_SECRET`. A session lasts "
"30 days by default (`accounts.session_ttl_days`), is never extended, and "
"ends at sign-out, a password change or reset, suspension or deletion. The"
" retired Gateway session cookie (`__Host-cloud_agent_session`) is never "
"read."
msgstr ""
"会话值是 `cals1.` 加 256 位随机数，数据库只保存它的 HMAC，密钥派生自 "
"`AGENT_LOCAL_SESSION_SECRET`。会话默认有效 30 "
"天（`accounts.session_ttl_days`），从不延长，在退出登录、修改或重置密码、停用或删除时结束。已停用的 Gateway "
"会话 cookie（`__Host-cloud_agent_session`）从不读取。"

#: ../developer/local-accounts.md:262
msgid ""
"Opening a session locks the account row before checking the password, so "
"a concurrent reset or suspension always wins."
msgstr "建立会话时先锁定账号行再校验密码，因此并发的重置或停用总是优先生效。"

#: ../developer/local-accounts.md:264
msgid "No recipient address or link is ever logged."
msgstr "日志中从不记录收件地址或链接。"

#: ../developer/local-accounts.md:266
msgid ""
"Abuse limits are fixed-window counters in Postgres, shared by every "
"worker and replica and keyed by hashes of the normalized identifier:"
msgstr "防滥用限制是 Postgres 中的固定窗口计数器，所有 worker 和副本共享，键为规范化标识的哈希："

