#: ../developer/local-accounts.md:301
msgid ""
"Mail links carry their token in the URL fragment (`/verify-"
"email#token=…`, `/reset-password#token=…`), which a browser never sends "
"to a server, so it stays out of access logs. The page sends the token in "
"a POST; following a link changes nothing by itself. Every unsafe "
"`/v1/auth/*` request passes the cross-site write guard, with or without a"
" cookie, and needs a JSON body; otherwise a cross-site sign-in could put "
"an attacker's account in the victim's browser."
msgstr ""
"邮件链接把令牌放在 URL 片段中（`/verify-email#token=…`、`/reset-"
"password#token=…`），浏览器从不把片段发给服务器，所以令牌不会出现在访问日志里。页面通过 POST "
"发送令牌；仅仅打开链接不会改变任何东西。每个非安全的 `/v1/auth/*` 请求，无论是否带 "
"cookie，都要经过跨站写入防护，并且请求体必须是 JSON；否则跨站登录可能把攻击者的账号放进受害者的浏览器。"

#: ../developer/local-accounts.md:309
msgid "The owner's own changes"
msgstr "本人的修改"

#: ../developer/local-accounts.md:311
msgid ""
"Each change is proven again the way the account signs in: with its "
"current password, counted against the sign-in limits, or for an account "
"without one, a code sent to its verified phone."
msgstr "每项修改都要按账号的登录方式重新证明身份：使用当前密码（计入登录限制），没有密码的账号则用发到已验证手机的验证码。"

#: ../developer/local-accounts.md
msgid "Change"
msgstr "修改"

#: ../developer/local-accounts.md
msgid "Rules"
msgstr "规则"

#: ../developer/local-accounts.md
msgid "Password"
msgstr "密码"

#: ../developer/local-accounts.md
msgid ""
"Change it, or set a phone account's first one. Other sessions end, open "
"reset links stop working, and a verified email is told"
msgstr "修改密码，或为手机号账号设置第一个密码。其他会话结束，未使用的重置链接失效，并通知已验证的邮箱"

#: ../developer/local-accounts.md
msgid "Email"
msgstr "邮箱"

#: ../developer/local-accounts.md
msgid ""
"A link goes to the new address, which replaces the old one only when "
"followed. The old address is told and its reset links stop working. "
"Whether an address is taken is answered only after the proof"
msgstr "链接发往新地址，只有打开链接后才替换旧地址。旧地址会收到通知，其重置链接随之失效。地址是否已被占用，只在证明身份后才告知"

#: ../developer/local-accounts.md
msgid "Phone"
msgstr "手机号"

#: ../developer/local-accounts.md
msgid ""
"Bind a code-proven number to an account that has none. A bound number is "
"not removed or replaced"
msgstr "为没有手机号的账号绑定一个经验证码证明的号码。绑定后的号码不能移除或更换"

#: ../developer/local-accounts.md
msgid "Delete"
msgstr "删除"

#: ../developer/local-accounts.md
msgid ""
"Type the account's identifier and give the proof. An administrator cannot"
" delete their own account. The account is soft-deleted (below)"
msgstr "输入账号的标识并完成证明。管理员不能删除自己的账号。账号会被软删除（见下文）"

#: ../developer/local-accounts.md
msgid "Language"
msgstr "语言"

#: ../developer/local-accounts.md
msgid ""
"Kept with the account; the latest choice wins, including one made in this"
" browser while signed out. One account's choice never moves to another "
"account in the same browser"
msgstr "随账号保存；以最近一次选择为准，包括在本浏览器未登录时做出的选择。一个账号的选择不会转移到同一浏览器中的其他账号"

#: ../developer/local-accounts.md:323
msgid "Deleting and erasing"
msgstr "删除与擦除"

#: ../developer/local-accounts.md:325
msgid ""
"Deleting an account, by its owner or an administrator, marks it "
"`deleted`. The same transaction revokes every session, takes the account "
"off every browser, ends open links and phone codes, turns approval into "
"revocation, writes an audit row, and opens a termination record that "
"stops its work ([below](#stopping-an-accounts-work)). Its data stays. "
"Once that cleanup is acknowledged, an administrator may resume the "
"account: it can sign in again, without Agent access."
msgstr ""
"账号由所有者或管理员删除后标记为 "
"`deleted`。同一事务会撤销所有会话、把账号从所有浏览器中移除、使未使用的链接和短信验证码失效、把批准变为撤销、写入审计行，并创建一条终止记录来停止它的工作（[见下文"
"](#stopping-an-accounts-work)）。它的数据保留。清理确认完成后，管理员可以恢复该账号：它可以再次登录，但没有 "
"Agent 访问权限。"

#: ../developer/local-accounts.md:333
msgid ""
"An administrator may then erase it, typing its id to confirm. Erasure is "
"refused with `erase_blocked` until the account is deleted, its "
"termination acknowledged, none of its turns queued, running or resident, "
"and every sandbox it owns deleted. It is also refused with "
"`host_cleanup_pending`, naming the runs and hosts, while a host still has"
" to clean up one of the account's environment runs; an offline host does "
"so when it reconnects."
msgstr ""
"之后管理员可以彻底清除它，需输入其 ID 确认。在账号已删除、终止已确认、没有排队中、运行中或常驻的轮次，且它拥有的每个沙箱都已删除之前，清除会以"
" `erase_blocked` 被拒绝。如果仍有主机需要清理该账号的某次环境运行，清除也会以 `host_cleanup_pending` "
"被拒绝，并列出相关运行和主机；离线的主机会在重新连接时完成清理。"

#: ../developer/local-accounts.md:340
msgid ""
"Teams are settled first. A team the account owns alone is deleted. A team"
" other members still use refuses erasure (`team_transfer_required`) until"
" an administrator hands it to a member from the account's review panel. "
"Invitations the account issued are revoked, and a team environment it "
"made stays with the team, recorded as the team owner's."
msgstr "清除前先处理团队。账号独自拥有的团队会被删除。仍有其他成员使用的团队会阻止清除（`team_transfer_required`），直到管理员在该账号的审核面板中把团队移交给某个成员。账号发出的邀请会被撤销，它创建的团队环境留在团队中，记为团队所有者的。"

#: ../developer/local-accounts.md:346
msgid ""
"Erasure removes every row of the account's Agent data and never another "
"owner's row; a row of another owner that refers to the account's data "
"blocks it. Identifiers, password, sessions, tokens, codes, sign-in events"
" and mail recipients go too. The admin audit trail keeps every row about "
"the account. The account row stays as an erased tombstone that every gate"
" denies and that can never be resumed. The erasure's own audit row lists "
"what was removed and the sandbox deletion archives left in the bucket, "
"which follow the bucket's retention policy. Ids in columns that name a "
"person without owning a row (team owners and creators, team audit actors "
"and targets, invitation creators, join-request deciders) stay, and "
"resolve to nobody."
msgstr ""
"清除会删掉账号 Agent "
"数据的每一行，但从不删除其他所有者的行；其他所有者的行如果引用了该账号的数据，清除就会被阻止。标识、密码、会话、令牌、验证码、登录事件和邮件收件记录也会一并删除。管理审计记录保留与该账号有关的每一行。账号行留作已清除的墓碑，所有门禁都拒绝它，且永远不能恢复。清除自身的审计行会列出删除了什么，以及留在存储桶中的沙箱删除归档；这些归档遵循存储桶的保留策略。只记录某人而不拥有行的列中的"
" ID（团队所有者和创建者、团队审计的操作者和对象、邀请创建者、加入申请的审批人）会保留，但不再指向任何人。"

#: ../developer/local-accounts.md:357
msgid "Mail to accounts"
msgstr "发送邮件给账号"

#: ../developer/local-accounts.md:359
msgid ""
"Administrators mail active or suspended accounts, chosen by account state"
" and application state, with a ready-made message (maintenance, "
"announcement) or a subject and a Markdown body (raw HTML is not "
"rendered). They preview the recipient count and the message, send a test "
"to themselves, then send now or at a chosen time, confirming the count. "
"Any change asks for a new preview. The recipients are fixed when the "
"message is created, and only verified addresses receive it. A message the"
" transport would refuse is refused at preview, with the reason: Tencent "
"SES sends only approved templates, and a message without its own goes "
"through the notice template, whose variables are limited to 800 bytes. "
"SMTP takes any message."
msgstr ""
"管理员可以按账号状态和申请状态选择活跃或已停用的账号群发邮件，使用现成消息（维护、公告），或自写主题和 Markdown 正文（不渲染原始 "
"HTML）。他们先预览收件人数和消息，给自己发一封测试邮件，然后立即发送或定时发送，并确认人数。任何改动都要重新预览。收件人在消息创建时就已确定，只有已验证的地址才会收到。发送方式会拒绝的消息在预览时就会被拒绝并说明原因：腾讯云"
" SES 只发送审核通过的模板，没有自己模板的消息会走通知模板，其变量限制为 800 字节。SMTP 接受任何消息。"

#: ../developer/local-accounts.md:370
msgid ""
"One process at a time sends a message, under a claim another process may "
"take over once it is 15 minutes old. Each recipient's outcome is recorded"
" as soon as their message is handed over, so a stopped sender resends "
"nothing; at most the one message in flight when the claim changed hands "
"can arrive twice. Accounts deleted since are skipped."
msgstr ""
"同一时间只有一个进程发送一条群发消息，它持有一个认领，认领满 15 "
"分钟后可被其他进程接管。每位收件人的结果在其邮件交出后立即记录，所以停下的发送进程不会重发；最多只有认领易手时正在发送的那一封可能收到两次。在此期间删除的账号会被跳过。"

#: ../developer/local-accounts.md:376
msgid "Stopping an account's work"
msgstr "停止账号的工作"

#: ../developer/local-accounts.md:378
msgid ""
"Revoking, suspending or deleting an account opens a termination record "
"(`agent_local_access_terminations`) for the new version in the same "
"transaction. From that commit, every new owner request, claim, goal "
"round, waiting message, residency establishment and residency heartbeat "
"is refused, so an attempt admitted earlier cannot start or extend a "
"residency."
msgstr ""
"撤销、停用或删除账号时，会在同一事务中为新版本创建一条终止记录（`agent_local_access_terminations`）。从提交那一刻起，每个新的所有者请求、认领、目标轮次、等待中的消息、residency"
" 建立和 residency 心跳都会被拒绝，所以此前已获准的 attempt 也无法建立或延长 residency。"

#: ../developer/local-accounts.md:384
msgid ""
"`terminate_owner_access` (`application/owner_termination.py`) then stops "
"the running work through the paths that already end work safely. It "
"cancels queued turns, asks running turns to stop, pauses waiting messages"
" and active goals, cancels environment tests and prebuilds, stops "
"environment actions, releases every residency and closes the released "
"member processes. In each sandbox group whose members all belong to the "
"account, it freezes the group's terminals, kills them and lifts the "
"freeze. Groups shared with another owner's chat are never touched."
msgstr ""
"随后 "
"`terminate_owner_access`（`application/owner_termination.py`）通过本来就能安全结束工作的路径停止正在进行的工作：取消排队的轮次，要求运行中的轮次停止，暂停等待中的消息和进行中的目标，取消环境测试和预构建，停止环境操作，释放每个"
" residency "
"并关闭被释放的成员进程。在成员全部属于该账号的每个沙箱组中，它冻结组内终端、终止它们，再解除冻结。与其他所有者的对话共享的组从不触碰。"

#: ../developer/local-accounts.md:393
msgid ""
"A background pass retries open records every 30 seconds, up to 50 "
"accounts per pass, under a per-account advisory lock. It closes a record "
"once terminal cleanup is acknowledged and none of the account's turns "
"runs. Approving the account or granting it administration needs that lock"
" and no open record (otherwise 409 `access_cleanup_pending`), so a late "
"pass never stops work that a newer approval allows. Restoring access "
"replays nothing: cancelled turns stay cancelled, and paused goals and "
"queues wait for their owner. No step has a wall-clock deadline: a failing"
" host or a backlog delays completion, and the open record keeps blocking "
"re-approval."
msgstr ""
"后台任务每 30 秒重试一次未关闭的记录，每轮最多 50 个账号，并持有按账号的 advisory "
"锁。终端清理确认完成、且该账号没有运行中的轮次时，记录关闭。批准该账号或授予其管理员身份需要同一把锁且没有未关闭的记录（否则返回 409 "
"`access_cleanup_pending`），因此迟到的后台任务不会停掉新批准所允许的工作。恢复访问不会重放任何东西：已取消的轮次保持取消，暂停的目标和队列等待所有者处理。没有任何步骤有固定的截止时间：持续出错的主机或积压会推迟完成，未关闭的记录会一直阻止重新批准。"

#: ../developer/local-accounts.md
msgid "Work"
msgstr "工作"

#: ../developer/local-accounts.md
msgid "When it is refused or checked (default settings)"
msgstr "拒绝或检查的时机（默认设置）"

#: ../developer/local-accounts.md
msgid ""
"New requests, claims, goal rounds, waiting messages, residency "
"establishment and heartbeats"
msgstr "新的请求、认领、目标轮次、等待消息，以及 residency 建立和心跳"

#: ../developer/local-accounts.md
msgid "Refused from the commit"
msgstr "从事务提交起拒绝"

#: ../developer/local-accounts.md
msgid "Open owner event, change and terminal streams"
msgstr "已打开的所有者事件流、变更流和终端流"

#: ../developer/local-accounts.md
msgid "Re-checked every 30 s (`LOCAL_STREAM_RECHECK_S`), between frames"
msgstr "每 30 秒（`LOCAL_STREAM_RECHECK_S`）重新检查一次，在帧与帧之间执行"

#: ../developer/local-accounts.md
msgid "A running turn"
msgstr "运行中的轮次"

#: ../developer/local-accounts.md
msgid ""
"Asked to stop by the first pass; it stops at its host's next heartbeat "
"(every 30 s), or when its 120 s attempt lease lapses if the host is "
"silent"
msgstr "首轮清理请求停止；在主机下次心跳时停止，心跳间隔为 30 秒；若主机无响应，则在 120 秒的 attempt 租约到期时停止"

#: ../developer/local-accounts.md
msgid "Resident member processes"
msgstr "驻留成员进程"

#: ../developer/local-accounts.md
msgid ""
"Closed by a pass, or at the host's next residency heartbeat, which no "
"longer extends them"
msgstr "由清理轮次关闭，或在主机下次 residency 心跳时关闭；该心跳不再延长 residency"

#: ../developer/local-accounts.md
msgid "Group terminals and environment actions"
msgstr "沙箱组终端与环境操作"

#: ../developer/local-accounts.md
msgid "Killed by a pass; retried at each check until the host acknowledges"
msgstr "由清理轮次终止；每次检查都会重试，直到主机确认完成"

#: ../developer/local-accounts.md:411
msgid "Models"
msgstr "模型"

#: ../developer/local-accounts.md:413
msgid ""
"After approval, an owner adds a model connection under **Settings → "
"Models** (`/settings/models`): a provider's Base URL, API key and model "
"IDs, then **Verify and save**. A failed check saves nothing, and only the"
" owner can use the connection. A deployment may also provide models under"
" **Admin → Settings → Models**. Their key stays in the control plane, and"
" every admitted owner can use the models it lists ([Provided "
"models](operations.md#provided-models))."
msgstr ""
"获批后，所有者在 **Settings → Models**（`/settings/models`）添加模型连接：填写服务商的 Base "
"URL、API 密钥和模型 ID，然后点 **Verify and save**。检查失败时不保存任何内容，连接也只有所有者本人能用。部署还可以在"
" **Admin → Settings → Models** "
"中提供模型。这类模型的密钥留在控制平面，每个获准的所有者都能使用它列出的模型（[Provided models](operations.md"
"#provided-models)）。"

#: ../developer/local-accounts.md:420
msgid ""
"There is no per-account quota or allowance. Costs and limits belong to "
"the provider key, the owner's or the deployment's, and separate Cloud "
"Agent accounts do not get separate provider quotas: keys from one "
"provider account share its allowance. Cloud Agent's sandbox and "
"concurrency limits are separate."
msgstr ""
"没有按账号的配额或额度。费用和限额都属于服务商密钥（所有者的或部署的）；不同的 Cloud Agent "
"账号不会因此得到各自的服务商配额：同一服务商账号下的密钥共享该账号的额度。Cloud Agent 的沙箱和并发限制是另外一回事。"

#: ../developer/local-accounts.md:426
msgid ""
"`GET /v1/agent/config` lists the provided sources and the owner's usable "
"connections, and sets `model_connection_required: true` when neither "
"offers a model. A task records its model ID and connection ID, and "
"follow-ups, queued turns, goals, Fork and residency keep that source; an "
"unavailable connection never falls back to a same-named model elsewhere. "
"A turn runs at Auto, the provider's default reasoning effort, unless the "
"owner picks a level that the provider's model listing declares and the "
"agent's CLI can send. Anything else is refused "
"(`model_connection_unusable` with reason `effort_unknown`, "
"`effort_unsupported` or `effort_level_unsupported`). See [owner model "
"connections](operations.md#owner-model-connections) for verification, key"
" handling and reasoning levels, and [usage](operations.md#usage) for what"
" the Usage pages count."
msgstr ""
"`GET /v1/agent/config` 列出部署提供的来源和所有者可用的连接，两者都没有可用模型时设置 "
"`model_connection_required: true`。任务会记录模型 ID 和连接 ID，后续消息、排队的轮次、目标、Fork 和 "
"residency 都沿用这个来源；不可用的连接绝不会退回到别处的同名模型。轮次默认以 "
"Auto（服务商默认的推理强度）运行，除非所有者选择了服务商模型列表声明、且 agent 的 CLI "
"能发送的级别。其他取值都会被拒绝（`model_connection_unusable`，原因为 "
"`effort_unknown`、`effort_unsupported` 或 "
"`effort_level_unsupported`）。验证、密钥处理和推理级别见 [owner model "
"connections](operations.md#owner-model-connections)，Usage 页面统计什么见 "
"[usage](operations.md#usage)。"

#: ../developer/local-accounts.md:439
msgid "Data model and tests"
msgstr "数据模型与测试"

#: ../developer/local-accounts.md:441
msgid ""
"The account tables are `agent_local_*`: `0108_local_accounts` creates "
"them, and `0109_local_account_parity` splits sign-in identities from "
"passwords and adds the rest."
msgstr ""
"账号相关的表都是 `agent_local_*`：由 `0108_local_accounts` "
"创建，`0109_local_account_parity` 把登录标识和密码拆开并添加其余的表。"

#: ../developer/local-accounts.md:445
msgid ""
"The rules, credentials, mail and parity features have unit tests "
"(`tests/unit/test_local_account_*.py`, "
"`tests/unit/test_independent_accounts_only.py`), and the HTTP surface has"
" `tests/servers/test_local_auth_surface.py`. The races, barriers, flows, "
"erasure, import and model onboarding run against real Postgres in "
"`tests/integration/storage/` and `tests/integration/servers/` (`make "
"test-db-local`); their model tests use a fake provider and forbid other "
"outbound calls, so they are not live-provider or Kata acceptance. The web"
" app's `Account*.test.tsx` files cover the pages with mocked API answers."
msgstr ""
"规则、凭据、邮件和对齐功能有单元测试（`tests/unit/test_local_account_*.py`、`tests/unit/test_independent_accounts_only.py`），HTTP"
" 接口有 `tests/servers/test_local_auth_surface.py`。并发竞争、屏障、完整流程、清除、导入和模型接入在 "
"`tests/integration/storage/` 和 `tests/integration/servers/` 中针对真实 "
"Postgres 运行（`make test-db-local`）；其中的模型测试使用假的服务商并禁止其他外部调用，所以不算真实服务商或 Kata"
" 验收。Web 应用的 `Account*.test.tsx` 文件用模拟的 API 响应覆盖这些页面。"

#: ../developer/local-accounts.md:455
msgid "Reused code"
msgstr "复用代码"

#: ../developer/local-accounts.md:457
msgid ""
"The password hashing and policy, the sign-up, sign-in, verification and "
"recovery behavior, the mail templates and the abuse limits are adapted "
"from HybridInference (`HarvardMadSys/hybridInference` at "
"`321e9a6c457dcc80d35977aaac472d54041204a8`, and later features at "
"`8b49872d1dcbed5c4bc8132b026b6740c3437aa7`; MIT License, Copyright (c) "
"2026 Harvard SEAS, the same license and holder as this repository). Each "
"adapted module names its source file. Nothing imports `serving.*`, and "
"nothing shares HybridInference's database, sessions, secrets or tokens."
msgstr ""
"密码哈希和策略、注册、登录、验证和找回的行为、邮件模板以及防滥用限制改编自 "
"HybridInference（`HarvardMadSys/hybridInference` 的 "
"`321e9a6c457dcc80d35977aaac472d54041204a8`，后续功能来自 "
"`8b49872d1dcbed5c4bc8132b026b6740c3437aa7`；MIT License，Copyright (c) 2026"
" Harvard SEAS，与本仓库的许可证和版权方相同）。每个改编的模块都注明了来源文件。没有任何代码导入 `serving.*`，也不共享 "
"HybridInference 的数据库、会话、密钥或令牌。"

#: ../developer/local-accounts.md:466
msgid ""
"Where Cloud Agent differs: a pending account can sign in; signing up with"
" a registered address changes nothing; a used link is refused; abuse "
"counters live in Postgres rather than in each process; tokens travel in "
"URL fragments; setup waits for an administrator instead of closing sign-"
"up; an erased account keeps a tombstone; administrator mail goes only to "
"verified addresses and renders Markdown without raw HTML; an address "
"accepted while verification is off is not trusted by the administrator or"
" domain lists until it is proven; the administrator list refuses "
"withdrawals it would undo; erasure hands shared teams over instead of "
"deleting them; mail Tencent SES cannot send is refused before it is "
"queued; and `argon2-cffi` is called directly rather than through "
"`passlib`."
msgstr ""
"与 HybridInference 的不同之处：待审批账号可以登录；用已注册地址注册不会改变任何东西；已用过的链接会被拒绝；防滥用计数器存在 "
"Postgres 中，而不是每个进程各自保存；令牌通过 URL "
"片段传递；首次设置会等待管理员出现，而不是关闭注册；被清除的账号保留墓碑；管理员群发邮件只发往已验证地址，渲染 Markdown 但不渲染原始 "
"HTML；关闭验证期间接受的地址在证明之前不受管理员名单和域名列表信任；管理员名单会拒绝它随后会自动恢复的撤权操作；清除时把共享团队移交出去，而不是删除；腾讯云"
" SES 无法发送的邮件在排队前就被拒绝；直接调用 `argon2-cffi`，而不是通过 `passlib`。"

